        "original_id": "ff9cd594-7ac1-5d6e-9e72-1cb138bb92d1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Warburton, Thomas Warburton, Mr. Warburton\n- Products: Codename: Kids Next Door, Beavis and Butt-Head, Pepper Ann\n- Companies: Cartoon Network\n- Roles: animator, producer, writer, designer, production designer, lead character designer\n- Topics: American animated television series, Cartoon Cartoons\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Warburton was born on August 31, 1968, and he is an American animator, producer, writer, and designer who is often credited as Mr. Warburton.\n- Tom Warburton served as production designer on the first season of Beavis and Butt-Head.\n- Tom Warburton was the lead character designer for the animated series Pepper Ann.\n- Codename: Kids Next Door is an American animated television series created by Tom Warburton for Cartoon Network.\n- Codename: Kids Next Door is commonly abbreviated as Kids Next Door or KND.\n- Codename: Kids Next Door was the 13th entry in Cartoon Network's Cartoon Cartoons lineup.",
